{"page":492,"verses":[{"verse_key":"43:34","surah":43,"ayah":34,"ar_uthmani":"وَلِبُيُوتِهِمْ أَبْوَٰبًا وَسُرُرًا عَلَيْهَا يَتَّكِـُٔونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"massive gates, couches to sit on,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلِبُيُوتِهِمْ","en_gloss":"And for their houses","transliteration":"walibuyūtihim","verse_key":"43:34"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَبْوَٰبًۭا","en_gloss":"doors","transliteration":"abwāban","verse_key":"43:34"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَسُرُرًا","en_gloss":"and couches","transliteration":"wasururan","verse_key":"43:34"},{"pos":4,"ar":"عَلَيْهَا","en_gloss":"upon which","transliteration":"ʿalayhā","verse_key":"43:34"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يَتَّكِـُٔونَ","en_gloss":"they recline","transliteration":"yattakiūna","verse_key":"43:34"},{"pos":6,"ar":"٣٤","en_gloss":"(34)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"43:34"}]},{"verse_key":"43:35","surah":43,"ayah":35,"ar_uthmani":"وَزُخْرُفًا ۚ وَإِن كُلُّ ذَٰلِكَ لَمَّا مَتَـٰعُ ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ ٱلدُّنْيَا ۚ وَٱلْـَٔاخِرَةُ عِندَ رَبِّكَ لِلْمُتَّقِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"and golden ornaments. All of these are mere enjoyments of this life; your Lord reserves the next life for those who take heed of Him.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَزُخْرُفًۭا ۚ","en_gloss":"And ornaments of gold","transliteration":"wazukh'rufan","verse_key":"43:35"},{"pos":2,"ar":"وَإِن","en_gloss":"And not (is)","transliteration":"wa-in","verse_key":"43:35"},{"pos":3,"ar":"كُلُّ","en_gloss":"all","transliteration":"kullu","verse_key":"43:35"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"dhālika","verse_key":"43:35"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لَمَّا","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"lammā","verse_key":"43:35"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مَتَـٰعُ","en_gloss":"an enjoyment","transliteration":"matāʿu","verse_key":"43:35"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ","en_gloss":"(of) the life","transliteration":"l-ḥayati","verse_key":"43:35"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلدُّنْيَا ۚ","en_gloss":"(of) the world","transliteration":"l-dun'yā","verse_key":"43:35"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَٱلْـَٔاخِرَةُ","en_glos